# Knowledge-base maintenance

**Canonical docs live here.** `scrap/` is archive — do not copy scrap into KB.

## File roles

| Path | Update when |
|------|-------------|
| `schemas/*.md` | Arango fields, workflow definition, state keys, DTOs |
| `apis/*.md` | Routes, status codes, side effects |
| `graph/dependencies.yaml` | New module, coupling, or renamed files |
| `graph/dependency-graph.md` | New layer or flow (mermaid only if needed) |
| `graph/CHANGE_IMPACT.md` | New change-type checklist row |
| `features/Fxx-*.md` | Per shipped feature (delta only) |
| `INDEX.md` | One row in features table — keep short |
| `changelog.md` | One dated bullet |

## Token rules

- No wall-of-text — tables and paths
- Link, don't duplicate `scrap/design/orqis_mvp_design.md`
- `INDEX.md` is the table of contents, not the spec

## New feature Fxx

1. Copy `feature-template.md`
2. List `dependencies.yaml` nodes to add/change
3. Do not edit `F00-mvp-baseline.md` for new work
